WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Help that fades.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.400
Teaching sessions are optional.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.800
When an adult uses them, V.O.I.C.E. can show a model
prompt and then take it away slowly.

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.800
A ring appears around the word to tap.

5
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.200
An adult can add Dibs the pigeon, or one of
his Chicago friends, too.

6
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.400
As the child succeeds, the help fades
in steps

7
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:31.600
until the child finds the word alone.

8
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:36.600
The adult gives the praise and the reward.

9
00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.800
The app does not.

10
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.200
For a sentence like “I want more,”

11
00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:48.600
V.O.I.C.E. can put the first words in the message
bar so the child finishes it,

12
00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:53.600
then the child does a little more each time.

13
00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:58.000
V.O.I.C.E. A free AAC app for children
who are new to AAC.
